{"about":["Enter the fractured psyche of Bruce Wayne and discover the powerful and far-reaching consequences of your choices as the Dark Knight. In this gritty and violent new story from the award-winning creators of The Walking Dead – A Telltale Games Series, you'll make discoveries that will shatter Bruce Wayne's world, and the already fragile stability of a corrupt Gotham City.","Your actions and your choices will determine the fate of the Batman.","Download Episode One of Batman: The Telltale Series, a five part episodic game series from the creators of The Walking Dead: A Telltale Games Series, The Wolf Among Us, and Tales from the Borderlands.","Offline single player","In-game purchases required","Software subject to license (us.playstation.com/softwarelicense)."],"shots":[{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/imf1g5islmlg9xq4xcsx.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/imf1g5islmlg9xq4xcsx.jpg"},{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/hh0nyyrebxreawpfwo62.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/hh0nyyrebxreawpfwo62.jpg"},{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/e12gvyst7lbowlgeiyfd.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/e12gvyst7lbowlgeiyfd.jpg"},{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/rzltthfdvqkurlg7iug6.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/rzltthfdvqkurlg7iug6.jpg"},{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/v3bjkra5dvjuyohql5zj.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/v3bjkra5dvjuyohql5zj.jpg"},{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/gcsxynzadtggqfjcrsfd.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/gcsxynzadtggqfjcrsfd.jpg"},{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ob3gj1shdjvse0pf2k5o.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t